                "description": "Deltana S44R4HDBNRP  4 x 4 x 1/4 Radius Heavy Duty with 2 Ball Bearings and Non-Removable pin. Heavy duty 0.129 thick,  Available in 7 different finishes. Package includes a pair of hinges (2) with matching finish steel flathead, Phillips Drive #12 x 1 wood screws and #12-24 x 1/2 machine screws.",
